			(property "Description" "50 ohm 250W BeO flanged RF termination (Vishay/Barry T50R0-250-12X). Off-board part: resistor body bolts to an external heatsink beside the PCB; only the RF tab and the flange's 2x GND ground-bond straps reach the PCB. This symbol is 2-PIN, matching the 3-pad footprint (pad 2 is duplicated x2 on the same pin/net, one strap land each side of the RF pad): pin 1 = RF (the tab lap pad), pin 2 = GND (the flange, reaching PCB GND ONLY through the two soldered copper straps - state.json decision 'Adopt architect B3'). The bolted flange-to-heatsink joint is explicitly NOT an electrical path (thermal/mechanical only) - see parts/T50R0-250-12X.json and the footprint's own descr for the full citation."
				(at 0 0 0)
				(hide yes)
				(effects
